Revision history for Elegant-Perl

Unreleased
    - Report validation failures at user call sites or saved field/contract
      declarations, including deferred CHECK validation. Repair the research
      billing example to pass typed caps and use constructor-injected state.
    - Allow optional field types (scalars, contracts, and caps), checked by
      generated constructors using the existing contract validators.
    - Fix critic policies crashing when PPI searches find no matching nodes.
    - Add named callback-based caps, explicit as_cap() issuance, and cap
      types in Expects/Returns contracts. Public method names are independent
      of private fields; callbacks receive the source object and arguments.

0.01  2026-10-08
    - Initial development release.
    - Add object DSL, contracts, runtime validation, Perl::Critic policies,
      and the elegant-perl command-line checker.
